# inkling-2-mini on Strata (github.com/Niko1221/Strata, MIT): Thinking Machines Inkling 2 Mini on the strata-inkling
# shape engine (C++/CUDA, .strata v1.1 packs, DSpark drafting, in-process vision) on the laptop's Thunderbolt RTX 5090
# (talos-8me-tcy). HELD 2026-11-22 after a lab: it lost to Basalt (apps/inkling2-mini-basalt.yaml) on every axis.
# Image: build/strata (official ghcr.io/niko1221/strata:0.2.19-cuda13 + our thinking-levels patch + start script).
# Packs: apps/inkling2-mini-strata-weights.yaml (SQ-20 lossless, SQ-15, vision shard, tokenizer).
#
# Measured 2026-11-22 (Strata 0.2.19 / strata-inkling 0.1.65, SQ-20, fp8 KV), same suite as the Basalt lab:
#   --max-context is PER SLOT (Basalt's is a total). KV is allocated up front at ~37.5 KiB/token at "fp8" (docs say
#   16 KiB): 1x32K 22.0 GB, 1x128K 25.6 GB, 1x256K 30.4 GB, 2x128K 27.9 GB of 32.6 -> about 310K tokens total
#   (Basalt: 2x256K + vision). 2x256K and 1x512K OOM at start; 2x128K OOMed mid-prefill at 52.7K of a 120K prompt and
#   the Python server never noticed (showed "reading the prompt" for 18 min). --kv k8v4/k8v8 report fp16, allocate
#   nothing up front, and segfault on a 100K-token prompt.
#   Speed: code 174 / prose 127 tok/s at temp 0, ~115 at temp 1.0 (Basalt ~310-330 / ~255), 2 streams 173 aggregate.
#   DSpark changed nothing (same tok/s with --draft dspark or DRAFTING=off). Prefill ~6K tok/s at 16K, 4.2K at 60K.
#   Prefix reuse: none, even for an append-only multi-turn chat (23.5K prompt re-read every turn, ~5 s; Basalt 0.4 s).
#   Quality fine: 20/20 multiplications, reasoning levels work with our patch.
# Upstream 0.2.19 also pins Inkling to reasoning_effort "none" (build/strata/patch_inkling_thinking.py restores levels).
# To retry a later release: rebuild build/strata on the new base image, rename this file back to .yaml, park Basalt
# (replicas 0) and the Collective inkling block, then remove the sleep command and restore the probes.
---
apiVersion: apps/v1
kind: Deployment
metadata:
  name: inkling-2-mini-strata
  namespace: default
  labels:
    app.kubernetes.io/name: inkling-2-mini
spec:
  replicas: 0                     # HELD 2026-11-22
  strategy:
    type: Recreate
  selector:
    matchLabels:
      app.kubernetes.io/name: inkling-2-mini
      app.kubernetes.io/component: strata
  template:
    metadata:
      labels:
        app.kubernetes.io/name: inkling-2-mini
        app.kubernetes.io/component: strata
    spec:
      runtimeClassName: nvidia
      enableServiceLinks: false
      nodeSelector: { home-k8s/egpu: rtx5090 }
      terminationGracePeriodSeconds: 60
      containers:
        - name: main
          command: ["sleep", "infinity"]   # LAB: idle, engine run by hand with kubectl exec
          image: ghcr.io/dbirks/strata:0.2.19-r1@sha256:8a8ed3346a5d5f8a8451dedac3ffd2b4fcea48ed71691870d73ee97e0f041b6c
          env:
            - { name: MODEL_FILE, value: "Inkling-2-Mini-SQ-20.strata" }
            - { name: MAX_CONTEXT, value: "262144" }   # PER SLOT in Strata (not a total like Basalt)
            - { name: PARALLEL, value: "2" }
            - { name: VISION, value: "1" }
            - { name: DRAFTING, value: "dspark" }
            - { name: ENGINE_ARGS, value: "--kv fp8" }
            - { name: STRATA_INKLING_EFFORT, value: "medium" }
            # DNS-rebinding guard: without an API key Strata answers only to these Host names (probes send one too)
            - { name: STRATA_ALLOWED_HOSTS, value: "inkling-2-mini,inkling-2-mini.default,inkling-2-mini.default.svc.cluster.local,localhost" }
            - { name: NVIDIA_VISIBLE_DEVICES, value: "all" }
            - { name: CUDA_DISABLE_CONTROL, value: "true" }
          ports:
            - containerPort: 8000
          resources:
            limits: { nvidia.com/gpu: "1", nvidia.com/gpumem-percentage: "100", cpu: "6", memory: 24Gi }
            requests: { cpu: "2", memory: 6Gi }
          volumeMounts:
            - { name: packs, mountPath: /models, readOnly: true }
            - { name: data, mountPath: /data }
            - { name: dshm, mountPath: /dev/shm }
      volumes:
        - name: packs
          persistentVolumeClaim:
            claimName: inkling2-mini-strata-packs
            readOnly: true
        - name: data
          emptyDir: { sizeLimit: 4Gi }
        - name: dshm
          emptyDir: { medium: Memory, sizeLimit: 2Gi }
